--- !u!114 &1000899248
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1000899245}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bd8247e9fc96a7f4c95b91b320ab5883, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcDialogue
  storyStates:
  - minimumStoryBeat: 0
    location: {fileID: 614649188}
    spriteOverride: {fileID: 0}
    overrideSortingOrder: 0
    sortingOrder: 0
    isVisible: 1
    isInteractable: 1
    lines:
    - speaker: Brendan
      text: Ah, hello. Security, right? First night?
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: 'That''s what they tell me. '
    - speaker: Brendan
      text: 'You''ll like it here. It''s quiet, mostly.  '
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: Mostly?
    - speaker: Brendan
      text: Quiet places still carry weight.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: What exactly is the work anyway?
    - speaker: Brendan
      text: 'Memory retention. Degenerative conditions. '
    - speaker: Brendan
      text: 'Things people pretend only happen to others until it happens to someone
        close to them. '
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: Someone close to you?
    - speaker: Brendan
      text: My mother.
    - speaker: Brendan
      text: 'By the end, she would recite songs from her childhood, but couldn''t
        remember my name. '
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: I'm sorry.
    - speaker: Brendan
      text: If Helix can give even one family more time, then the work matters.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: That's a lot to carry.
    - speaker: Brendan
      text: It is.
    - speaker: Brendan
      text: But it feels lighter when you can do something.
    repeatLines:
    - speaker: Brendan
      text: Sometimes a little more time isn't so little.
    storyBeatAfterDialogue: -1
  - minimumStoryBeat: 3
    location: {fileID: 1183980820}
    spriteOverride: {fileID: -785796111436880725, guid: 636f4c3aa66cc8a4ea648a4aa1a50537, type: 3}
    overrideSortingOrder: 1
    sortingOrder: 4
    isVisible: 1
    isInteractable: 0
    lines: []
    repeatLines: []
    storyBeatAfterDialogue: 0
  useScenePlacementForInitialState: 1
  faceDownSprite: {fileID: -3121443740358012084, guid: 636f4c3aa66cc8a4ea648a4aa1a50537, type: 3}
  faceUpSprite: {fileID: -785796111436880725, guid: 636f4c3aa66cc8a4ea648a4aa1a50537, type: 3}
