--- !u!114 &2065954677
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2065954674}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bd8247e9fc96a7f4c95b91b320ab5883, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcDialogue
  storyStates:
  - minimumStoryBeat: 0
    location: {fileID: 1882511324}
    spriteOverride: {fileID: 0}
    overrideSortingOrder: 0
    sortingOrder: 0
    isVisible: 1
    isInteractable: 1
    lines:
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: What do you do here?
    - speaker: Janet
      text: Records, mostly. Trial notes, intake forms, batch logs.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: Paperwork.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: Evidence.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: That's a generous word for it.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: It's the right word.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: If something works once, that's interesting.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: If it works the same way twice, under the same conditions, that's science.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: And if it doesn't?
    - speaker: Janet
      text: Then someone has to record that, too.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: You sound like you care about that.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: I do.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: Why?
    - speaker: Janet
      text: 'My uncle was part of an early trial. '
    - speaker: Janet
      text: Back then, the good days were rare.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: 'But after the treatment, he had more of them. '
    - speaker: Janet
      text: Enough to know my aunt when she came into the room.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: 'Enough to ask for music he liked. '
    - speaker: Janet
      text: Enough that the end wasn't only that look people get when they don't
        know where they are or what's going on.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: And that brought you here?
    - speaker: Janet
      text: I suppose it did.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: Sounds like you've been here a while.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: A few months, I think.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: Long enough to see what gets sent upstairs.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: And what's that?
    - speaker: Janet
      text: Numbers. Trial notes. Outcomes.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: Most of it looks small on paper.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: A name remembered. A pattern repeated. A bad week that wasn't quite as
        bad as the last.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: And that makes it worth it?
    - speaker: Janet
      text: 'It makes it matter. '
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: You hope.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: I hope more people get what my uncle got.
    - speaker: Janet
      text: 'More time to be themselves. '
    repeatLines:
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: Still writing things down?
    - speaker: Janet
      text: Someone has to.
    storyBeatAfterDialogue: -1
  - minimumStoryBeat: 3
    location: {fileID: 1225133734}
    spriteOverride: {fileID: 5047860432093209060, guid: 1efca26c370357d469ed791b4a47619d, type: 3}
    overrideSortingOrder: 0
    sortingOrder: 0
    isVisible: 1
    isInteractable: 0
    lines: []
    repeatLines: []
    storyBeatAfterDialogue: 0
  useScenePlacementForInitialState: 1
  faceDownSprite: {fileID: -11634719445743900, guid: 1efca26c370357d469ed791b4a47619d, type: 3}
